libYoYoGamepad.dylib is proprietary software of YoYo Games / Opera. It is
not covered by an open-source license and no explicit redistribution
permission exists.

This copy was extracted unaltered from a GameMaker Studio 2 macOS export
published on GitHub (the "puppy-park" project by KristinDolan,
https://github.com/KristinDolan/puppy-park), code-signed 2024-07-08.

It is bundled here only as a drop-in replacement for the older build of the
same library already shipped with the game, for personal use. All rights
remain with YoYo Games / Opera.
